[CENTER][SIZE=6][B]Expressive Launcher 5.1.3 (Build 75) — Hold to Search[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4][I]Official Release Announcement & Download Links[/I][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[HR][/HR]

5.1.3 is a one-fix update for ExpressiveOS. Circle to Search now works from Expressive Launcher: touch and hold the navigation handle to search what's on your screen. Phones that don't run Expressive Launcher as a built-in system app see no change.

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]✨ What's New & Improved[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=5][B]1. 🔍 Circle to Search from Expressive Launcher[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Before[/B]: on ExpressiveOS, holding the navigation handle did nothing while Expressive Launcher was your launcher. The launcher never asked Android for the permission that starts Circle to Search, so it stopped before trying.
[*][B]Now[/B]: the launcher asks for it. Android only grants it to a launcher built into the system with an allowlist entry, which ExpressiveOS 1.1.2 adds. On other phones Android doesn't grant it, and the launcher behaves exactly as before.

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]😄 Launcher Humor[/B][/SIZE]

[QUOTE]🔍 [I]The navigation handle has been working out for months. Now it finally gets to hold something.[/I][/QUOTE]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]💬 Community Notes[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Who notices[/B]: ExpressiveOS users on 1.1.2 or newer with Expressive Launcher as their launcher.
[*][B]Where the setting is[/B]: Settings > System > Circle to Search (ExpressiveOS turns it on by default).
[*][B]Validation[/B]: see Verification & Technical Details below.
[*][B]Developer Support[/B]: Expressive Pro is available as a one-time $4.99 activation. Every dollar funds the build servers, test devices and signing pipeline that keep Expressive fast, independent and ad-free.

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]🧩 Release Riddle[/B][/SIZE]

[QUOTE][I]I live at the bottom of your screen. Swipe me and I take you home; hold me and I take you anywhere. What am I?[/I][/QUOTE]

[SPOILER="Tap to reveal answer"][B]The navigation handle![/B] Since 5.1.3, holding it opens Circle to Search on ExpressiveOS. 🔍[/SPOILER]

[HR][/HR]

